SCOPE

This license governs the content and code of examgrid.exams ("the
Repository"): the static registry of exam manifests, encrypted exam
files and access data consumed by examgrid. It does not grant, and is
not required for, ordinary access to the examgrid web application at
its official deployment: the web app itself is freely accessible to the
public, without any license, account, or fee, simply as an end user
browsing the site.

